  "prompt": "What does this JavaScript program print to the console?\n\n```javascript\nfunction announce() {\n  console.log(name);\n  var name = 'dailyquest';\n  console.log(name);\n}\n\nannounce();\n```",
  "instructions": [
    "Predict the exact console output before revealing the solution."
  ],
